          "hideComponent": "false",
          "jcr:created": "Mon Jun 16 2025 13:59:03 GMT+0000",
          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-75em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">Craniomaxillofacial division program overview</span></span></p>\n<p>At Stryker, we recognize the important role that educational grants and charitable contributions play in our mission, both in benefits to patient care and the advancement of medical technology, treatment, and knowledge.</p>\n<p>Factors our committee considers as part of the review process may include the following: content, audience, location, and budget. On an annual basis, we receive hundreds of requests and we aim to provide responsible support. Due to finite resources, not every quality program will receive support.</p>\n<p>All requests must be submitted at least 8 weeks prior to the program start date.</p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Mon Jun 16 2025 15:50:12 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        },
