          "text": "<p><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-75em\">Application link</span></span></p>\n<p>To register and apply for a grant or donation from Stryker's Craniomaxillofacial division, please visit<br>\n<span class=\"standalone-link\"><a href=\"https://globalrequests.stryker.com/\" target=\"_blank\">globalrequests.stryker.com</a></span><br>\n</p>\n",
